# UX workflow: edit Pattern and Step directly with OPT.
# Purpose: validates the canonical direct-OPT grammar outside held selector
# overlays: Pattern focus edits the selected pattern dimension and Step focus
# edits the selected musical property for the focused step.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_track_ready

# Pattern focus: OPT edits the selected pattern dimension and shows transient
# pattern-dimension feedback without holding LEFT_CENTER.
150 tap NAV 60
350 capture screen pattern_focus_ready
450 encoder OPT 0.25
600 capture screen pattern_direct_opt_feedback
1450 tick
1500 capture screen pattern_direct_opt_feedback_expired

# Step focus: OPT edits the focused step property without exposing the Pattern
# quick-control strip.
1600 tap NAV 60
1800 capture screen step_focus_ready
1900 encoder OPT 1.00
2050 capture screen step_direct_opt_feedback
2900 tick
2950 capture screen step_direct_opt_feedback_expired
